@startuml
title Foro - Mensajes históricos + tiempo real

actor Usuario as U
participant "ForumPage" as Forum
participant "Backend /api/forum/messages" as ForumREST
participant "Socket.io Server" as Socket
participant "Socket.io Client" as Client

U -> Forum : Entrar a /forum (requiere auth)
Forum -> ForumREST : GET /api/forum/messages + JWT
ForumREST --> Forum : mensajes históricos

Forum -> Client : connect Socket.io\n(transports websocket+polling)

Forum -> U : render feed

== Enviar mensaje ==
U -> Forum : Escribir mensaje + Submit
Forum -> ForumREST : POST /api/forum/messages {content} + JWT
ForumREST --> Socket : emitir evento (forum:new)
Socket --> Client : evento forum:new(msg)
Client -> Forum : upsertMessage(msg)

@enduml

